  "verification_evidence": "\"Experiments were conducted in medium containing (per liter of medium): 0.9 g NaCl, 0.9 g NH4CL, 0.2 g MgSO4 * 7H2O, 0.75 g KH2PO4, 1.94 g K2HPO4 * 3H2O, 0.02 g CaCl2 and 0.5 mg resazurin.\" Trace elements: \"1.5 mg FeCl2 * 4 H2O, 0.070 mg ZnCl2, 0.025 mg FeCl3 * 6 H2O, 0.1 mg MnCl * 4 H2O, 0.006 mg H3BO3, 0.190 mg CoCl2 * 6H2O, 0.002 mg CuCl2 * 2 H2O, 0.024 mg NiCl2 * 6 H2O, 0.2 mg Na2WO4, 0.056 mg",
